    "sections": {
        "description": "Carpets and Rugs is a clean and structured theme designed for websites related to flooring, interior decor, home textiles, and furniture businesses. The theme is suitable for carpet stores, rug sellers, interior designers, home decor shops, wholesalers, and small business owners who want to showcase products, catalogs, and services online. It includes organized product sections, gallery layouts, customizable colors, typography options, and responsive design for mobile and desktop devices. The theme supports product images, collections, contact forms, and location information, making it useful for both online stores and business websites. With simple layout settings, banner sections, product grids, and service pages, users can easily create a professional website for home decor, flooring services, interior design portfolios, and online product catalogs related to carpets, rugs, mats, and home furnishing products."
    },
